#: ../../source/docs/common-velocity-can-escs.rst:5
#: a74dcb4da09e405f9e8abfc0768d674d
msgid "Currawong Velocity CAN ESCs"
msgstr "Currawong Velocity CAN ESC"

#: ../../source/docs/common-velocity-can-escs.rst:9
#: c433b6a6d905460f83e3366d995af486
msgid ""
"Currawong's `Velocity range of ESCs <https://www.currawongeng.com/servos-"
"escs/velocity/>`__ provide motor control for the aerospace sector, with a "
"high degree of reliability."
msgstr ""
"Currawong 的 `Velocity 系列 ESC <https://www.currawongeng.com/servos-"
"escs/velocity/>`__ 为航空航天领域提供高可靠性的电机控制。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-velocity-can-escs.rst:11
#: bddf06a0e9d54aafab03eaeb229d4931
msgid ""
"Designed for driving extremely large motors for heavy-lift applications, the"
" Velocity range of ESCs is available in power levels above 20kW"
msgstr "专为驱动重载应用中的超大型电机而设计，Velocity 系列 ESC 的功率等级超过 20kW"

#: ../../source/docs/common-velocity-can-escs.rst:13
#: 7dbac191b6b243b58564a45dafbe43e9
msgid "Up to 18S (75V) battery packs"
msgstr "支持最高 18S（75V）电池组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-velocity-can-escs.rst:14
#: 3790f1642b8b43a0a0571df2db51a4cf
msgid "Sustained currents above 300A"
msgstr "持续电流超过 300A"

#: ../../source/docs/common-velocity-can-escs.rst:15
#: 30f44b0c875245b89ffa8a2f74c31c7b
msgid "Compact design"
msgstr "紧凑设计"

#: ../../source/docs/common-velocity-can-escs.rst:16
#: f3bf08e1ee1d45e4bef3b835f0395020
msgid "Fully isolated communication interface"
msgstr "完全隔离的通信接口"

#: ../../source/docs/common-velocity-can-escs.rst:17
#: 8eb3a431fa3f489bbc74f85c35c5174b
msgid "Designed and manufactured in Australia"
msgstr "澳大利亚设计制造"

#: ../../source/docs/common-velocity-can-escs.rst:19
#: c81d54725a944653a2b632f7dc7fe7a1
msgid ""
"The Velocity ESC provides a CAN communication interface for commands and "
"telemetry. A traditional digital PWM interface is also supported. They "
"support both PiccoloCAN and DroneCAN protocols."
msgstr ""
"Velocity ESC 提供用于命令和数传的 CAN 通信接口，同时也支持传统数字 PWM 接口。支持 PiccoloCAN 和 DroneCAN "
"协议。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-velocity-can-escs.rst:21
#: 16b202f9ba674f6f9637f2bfe57527ee
msgid ""
"Additionally, the Velocity ESC provides an optional hardware interlock for "
"increased operator safety."
msgstr "此外，Velocity ESC 提供可选的硬件联锁，以增强操作员安全性。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-velocity-can-escs.rst:24
#: 1ce3820f2b0a4f97b31f8b908b5b67eb
msgid "Where to Buy"
msgstr "购买渠道"

#: ../../source/docs/common-velocity-can-escs.rst:26
#: e1c18fd37b744bff86c65f99d8853877
msgid ""
"Contact `Currawong Engineering <https://www.currawongeng.com/about-"
"us/contact-us/>`__ for purchasing details."
msgstr ""
"请联系 `Currawong Engineering <https://www.currawongeng.com/about-us/contact-"
"us/>`__ 获取购买详情。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-velocity-can-escs.rst:30
#: c612cb59e0a0476e9a2577e7e64ac508
msgid "PiccoloCAN Setup"
msgstr "PiccoloCAN 设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-velocity-can-escs.rst:34
#: e4b50f92f27a44eb9357a5bd6a8d7b88
msgid ""
"The Velocity ESC supports the PiccoloCAN protocol. Originally developed for "
"the Piccolo autopilot, the protocol is now natively supported by ArduPilot"
msgstr "Velocity ESC 支持 PiccoloCAN 协议。该协议最初为 Piccolo 飞控开发，现已在 ArduPilot 中原生支持"

#: ../../source/docs/common-velocity-can-escs.rst:37
#: ../../source/docs/common-velocity-can-escs.rst:69
#: 17e4a8a19ea748529f03d86c205e4657 7a4670c059c74b66a0ad1da5b4d8b0b7
msgid "ArduPilot Configuration"
msgstr "ArduPilot 配置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-velocity-can-escs.rst:39
#: 09f1fb4ffe8b4c07af323bb22db88051
msgid ""
"To enable communication with the Velocity ESCs using PiccoloCAN, the "
"following parameters must be set."
msgstr "要使用 PiccoloCAN 启用与 Velocity ESC 的通信，必须设置以下参数。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-velocity-can-escs.rst:41
#: 92b7aa29097d46438d90f8426ceefc1a
msgid "Set :ref:`CAN_D1_PROTOCOL <CAN_D1_PROTOCOL>` = 4 (PiccoloCAN)"
msgstr "设置 :ref:`CAN_D1_PROTOCOL <CAN_D1_PROTOCOL>` = 4（PiccoloCAN）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-velocity-can-escs.rst:42
#: 6cc81a4607e34fa59152b0c31188cd11
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`CAN_P1_DRIVER <CAN_P1_DRIVER>` = 1 (First driver) to specify that "
"the ESCs are connected to the CAN1 port"
msgstr ""
"设置 :ref:`CAN_P1_DRIVER <CAN_P1_DRIVER>` = 1（第一驱动器），以指定 ESC 连接到 CAN1 端口"

#: ../../source/docs/common-velocity-can-escs.rst:44
#: 0366739750a449418f83387d2949b8c5
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`MOT_PWM_MIN <MOT_PWM_MIN>` = 1000 and :ref:`MOT_PWM_MAX "
"<MOT_PWM_MAX>` = 2000 so ArduPilot uses an output range that matches the "
"ESCs input range"
msgstr ""
"设置 :ref:`MOT_PWM_MIN <MOT_PWM_MIN>` = 1000 以及 :ref:`MOT_PWM_MAX "
"<MOT_PWM_MAX>` = 2000，使 ArduPilot 使用与 ESC 输入范围匹配的输出范围"

#: ../../source/docs/common-velocity-can-escs.rst:47
#: 89a2a791dbfc41be855c70cd7f4d4819
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`MOT_SPIN_ARM <MOT_SPIN_ARM>` = 0.03 meaning the motors will spin "
"at 3% of full thrust when armed"
msgstr "设置 :ref:`MOT_SPIN_ARM <MOT_SPIN_ARM>` = 0.03，表示解锁时电机将以最大推力的 3% 转速旋转"

#: ../../source/docs/common-velocity-can-escs.rst:48
#: 764ec478685e4093bd1e6cd3a9a342d3
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`MOT_SPIN_MIN <MOT_SPIN_MIN>` = 0.05 meaning the motors will spin "
"at no less than 5% of full thrust when flying"
msgstr "设置 :ref:`MOT_SPIN_MIN <MOT_SPIN_MIN>` = 0.05，表示飞行时电机转速不低于最大推力的 5%"

#: ../../source/docs/common-velocity-can-escs.rst:51
#: 3d29f5182ed241b28187f8eb76cc4a9c
msgid ""
"Set ``SERVOx_FUNCTION`` to each motor channel (e.g. 33 - 40 for motors 1 - "
"8). This is automatically configured when setting frame class/type. If a "
"motor channel isn't assigned to a servo output, commands won't be sent to "
"the associated ESC."
msgstr ""
"把 ``SERVOx_FUNCTION`` 设到各电机通道（如电机 1 - 8 对应 33 - "
"40）。设置机架类别/类型时会自动完成此配置。如果某个电机通道未分配到舵机输出，命令就不会发送到对应的 ESC。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-velocity-can-escs.rst:53
#: 44e62d6fb508477c9ec0e35fdc967d80
msgid ""
"By default, all configured motor channels are used to send control commands "
"to Velocity ESCs. These control messages are transmitted by the autopilot at"
" a default rate of 50Hz. These parameters can be modified using:"
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，所有已配置的电机通道都用于向 Velocity ESC 发送控制命令。这些控制消息由飞控以默认 50Hz 频率发送。可通过以下参数修改："

#: ../../source/docs/common-velocity-can-escs.rst:55
#: 76f5a7b3ef76481388cee5137755cfde
msgid ""
"The :ref:`CAN_D1_PC_ESC_BM <CAN_D1_PC_ESC_BM>` parameter is a bitmask that "
"determines which ESC (motor) channels are transmitted over CAN"
msgstr ""
":ref:`CAN_D1_PC_ESC_BM <CAN_D1_PC_ESC_BM>` 参数是一个位掩码，决定哪些 ESC（电机）通道通过 CAN 发送"

#: ../../source/docs/common-velocity-can-escs.rst:56
#: 596425eb0ceb44249d76b893e227701f
msgid ""
"The :ref:`CAN_D1_PC_ESC_RT <CAN_D1_PC_ESC_RT>` parameter determines the rate"
" (Hz) at which commands are sent out to the connected Velocity ESCs"
msgstr ""
":ref:`CAN_D1_PC_ESC_RT <CAN_D1_PC_ESC_RT>` 参数决定向已连接的 Velocity ESC "
"发送命令的速率（Hz）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-velocity-can-escs.rst:59
#: ../../source/docs/common-velocity-can-escs.rst:73
#: 5c9549be949341219c5b0e550086e946 6144dbcbab134647b435f73cd80afe52
msgid "ESC Configuration"
msgstr "ESC 配置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-velocity-can-escs.rst:60
#: 3d14e3e8ee2141c8974882e2e88d4b07
msgid ""
"The following configuration settings should be used on the Velocity ESC for "
"operation with Ardupilot:"
msgstr "在与 ArduPilot 配合使用时，应在 Velocity ESC 上使用以下配置设置："

#: ../../source/docs/common-velocity-can-escs.rst:62
#: 0864ed2ab82e4cc5b7465f129e829d9b
msgid ""
"Set Piccolo Node ID to the motor channel the ESC should listen to. Note this"
" may not be the same as the configured servo output number."
msgstr "将 Piccolo Node ID 设置为 ESC 应监听的电机通道。注意这可能与已配置的舵机输出编号不同。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-velocity-can-escs.rst:63
#: 3eb59b936f6345a5b5f5c39ffd81c5e1
msgid "Enable ``Listen for Broadcast Commands``."
msgstr "启用 ``Listen for Broadcast Commands``。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-velocity-can-escs.rst:66
#: c3b800782ea34e7897e420d4e47f5f15
msgid "DroneCAN Setup"
msgstr "DroneCAN 设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-velocity-can-escs.rst:70
#: eb20865642e54cad9ac6677597870bcb
msgid "Refer to :ref:`DroneCAN ESCs Autopilot Setup<common-uavcan-escs>`."
msgstr "请参阅 :ref:`DroneCAN ESCs Autopilot Setup<common-uavcan-escs>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-velocity-can-escs.rst:74
#: 60a83b8eb33c43818d5101ba20607698
msgid ""
"To configure the ESC to receive commands from ``SERVOx`` output, set "
"``dronecan.escIndex`` to ``x - 1`` (e.g. for ``SERVO5``, set ``escIndex`` = "
"4). Note that this is different to PiccoloCAN, where motor channels are "
"assigned to node ids, rather than servo output channels to the ``escIndex``."
msgstr ""
"要配置 ESC 接收来自 ``SERVOx`` 输出的命令，将 ``dronecan.escIndex`` 设置为 ``x - 1`` （例如，对于 "
"``SERVO5``，设置 ``escIndex`` = 4）。注意这与 PiccoloCAN 不同，后者将电机通道分配给节点 "
"ID，而非将舵机输出通道分配给 ``escIndex``。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-velocity-can-escs.rst:75
#: b3f602af6a28490aa81ff0cbfeb8e26d
msgid ""
"Telemetry periods can be configured with the ``dronecan.messagePeriods`` "
"settings."
msgstr "数传周期可通过 ``dronecan.messagePeriods`` 设置配置。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-velocity-can-escs.rst:76
#: e193b720e9a34b21a2f5fb50a4a89594
msgid ""
"By default, the ESC respects arming messages from the Autopilot. To always "
"software enable the ESC when a command is received, and ignore arming "
"messages, set ``config.swInhibit`` = 1 (False)."
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，ESC 遵循飞控的解锁消息。若要在收到命令时始终软件启用 ESC 并忽略解锁消息，设置 ``config.swInhibit`` = "
"1（False）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-velocity-can-escs.rst:78
#: accaa865d26d48029ed1656761905d46
msgid ""
"By default, the Velocity ESC is configured to use Dynamic Node id Allocation"
" (DNA). ``dronecan.nodeId`` should be set to \"0\" (to use DNA), unless all "
"devices on the CAN bus are configured to use static IDs."
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，Velocity ESC 配置为使用动态节点 ID 分配（DNA）。除非 CAN 总线上的所有设备都配置为使用静态 ID，否则 "
"``dronecan.nodeId`` 应设置为 「0」（以使用 DNA）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-velocity-can-escs.rst:80
#: 1ff75b0cada0477bb3da90860614ae7e
msgid ""
"Only the DroneCAN specific settings are shown when fetching settings using "
"the DroneCAN protocol. The full suite of Velocity ESC settings can be "
"configured by enabling the ``show_advanced`` setting."
msgstr ""
"使用 DroneCAN 协议获取设置时，只显示 DroneCAN 特定设置。可通过启用 ``show_advanced`` 设置来配置 Velocity"
" ESC 的完整设置套件。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-velocity-can-escs.rst:84
#: 8aaf826bddb9456fb6e68c063e70869d
msgid ""
"It is recommended to configure your motor, and perform ESC and motor "
"validation using PiccoloCAN with CEquip, and swap to DroneCAN, if required, "
"during vehicle integration."
msgstr ""
"建议使用 PiccoloCAN 配合 CEquip 配置电机并进行 ESC 和电机验证，并在飞行器集成期间（如需）切换到 DroneCAN。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-velocity-can-escs.rst:87
#: 642974a819624086a361658831730e02
msgid "Logging and Reporting"
msgstr "日志记录与报告"

#: ../../source/docs/common-velocity-can-escs.rst:89
#: e5507b8e7979435f887da201f30dd0c0
msgid ""
"Velocity ESCs provide comprehensive telemetry information back to the "
"autopilot which is recorded in the autopilot's onboard log, and can be "
"viewed in any :ref:`ArduPilot compatible log viewer <common-logs>`.  This "
"information includes:"
msgstr ""
"Velocity ESC 向飞控提供全面的数传信息，记录在飞控的机载日志中，可在任意 :ref:`ArduPilot 兼容日志查看器 <common-"
"logs>` 中查看。这些信息包括："

#: ../../source/docs/common-velocity-can-escs.rst:91
#: 9b327dfacb2a40398bf503356aec9121
msgid "RPM"
msgstr "RPM"

#: ../../source/docs/common-velocity-can-escs.rst:92
#: c5caddd34c2b47579caeb26b743c400d
msgid "Voltage"
msgstr "电压"

#: ../../source/docs/common-velocity-can-escs.rst:93
#: cb1ba1547581450abe01b15d25844c30
msgid "ESC Temperature"
msgstr "ESC 温度"

#: ../../source/docs/common-velocity-can-escs.rst:94
#: 80e89e3b871f47299959cef8aef04d9f
msgid "Motor current"
msgstr "电机电流"

#: ../../source/docs/common-velocity-can-escs.rst:95
#: b6e9452eba904c48990b99b76539e4de
msgid "Motor Temperature (when used with an external sensor)"
msgstr "电机温度（使用外置传感器时）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-velocity-can-escs.rst:97
#: dac20d7b763d437a9360d18e03817267
msgid ""
"This information (except the motor temperature) can also be viewed in real-"
"time using a ground station.  If using the Mission Planner go to the Flight "
"Data screen's status tab and look for (e.g.) esc1_rpm."
msgstr ""
"此信息（电机温度除外）也可通过地面站实时查看。如果使用 Mission Planner，进入飞行数据界面的 status "
"选项卡，查找（例如）esc1_rpm。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-velocity-can-escs.rst:105
#: 1a12427e6f094ea89ab31951f87a8497
msgid ""
"Sending ESC data to the GCS requires using MAVLink2.  Please check the "
"appropriate SERIALx_PROTOCOL parameter is 2 (where \"x\" is the serial port "
"number used for the telemetry connection)."
msgstr ""
"将 ESC 数据发送到 GCS 需要使用 MAVLink2。请检查相应的 SERIALx_PROTOCOL 参数是否为 2（其中 「x」 "
"是用于数传连接的串口编号）。"
